00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:20.115
And we can mess around
with this now and see it

00:16:20.115 --> 00:16:20.990
in a variety of ways.

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:24.890
If we want to have a look at
it as a fleet, for example,

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:28.687
we can see here that there's
