00:16:31.647 --> 00:16:33.230
and so it takes a
little bit sometimes

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:36.278
to pull down to a machine, but
it'll be there in a minute.

00:16:36.278 --> 00:16:38.070
And we can see some
various things on here.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:42.360
So if we want to scale
this we can do so.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.270
So let's just scale the fleet.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:48.276
kubectl fleet.

00:16:48.276 --> 00:16:51.958
I'm typing down here
so it's always fun.

00:16:51.958 --> 00:16:53.562
kubectl fleet xonotic.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:58.966
I know what I did wrong, sorry.

00:16:58.966 --> 00:17:00.680
Scale.

