00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.470
There we go.

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:43.020
Awesome.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.390
So that's now
working [INAUDIBLE]..

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.810
We have pre-built Grafana
dashboards and hooks

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:50.130
into Prometheus.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.840
So we use a library
called OpenCensus

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.190
for doing our
statistics and metrics.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:58.680
So you can use either Prometheus
or Stackdriver if you want,

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:02.180
or pretty much anything that
OpenCensus will support.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.930
So if we want to have
a look here and have

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.240
a look at our number of
game servers, for example--

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.697
that is tiny and you
can't see anything--

00:18:08.697 --> 00:18:11.280
you'll start to see the number
of games servers start to grow.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:13.863
This is usually running a little
bit slower than what actually

00:18:13.863 --> 00:18:16.140
is happening, and we
can start to see things

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:19.090
like how fast our game
servers are coming up.

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:23.010
We can start to see rates
of what state they're in,

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.720
what fleet numbers
they have, how they're

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.700
distributed across our cluster.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.818
There's a variety of
different types of statistics

00:18:28.818 --> 00:18:30.360
that we're able to
take advantage of,

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:32.107
which is really, really nice.

00:18:32.107 --> 00:18:33.440
They're starting to come up now.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:34.770
We have about 100 or so.

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:37.097
That's pretty nice.

00:18:37.097 --> 00:18:39.180
So we can do all sorts of
fun things here as well.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.616
So if we have a look at
our fleet-- there we go.

00:18:40.616 --> 00:18:41.616
We have about 106 ready.

00:18:41.616 --> 00:18:43.128
That's much better.

00:18:43.128 --> 00:18:44.420
They're coming up pretty quick.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.680
So let's actually
