00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.730
and we'll play with that.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:56.290
So kubectl create -f examples
xonotic gameserverallocation.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:19:00.390
So again, you would probably do
this through a Kubernetes API

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:02.310
call, but we're
going to just do this

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:04.820
