You just want to do
some light testing.

00:43:24.790 --> 00:43:27.590
We can do some SDK local
tooling, things like that,

00:43:27.590 --> 00:43:29.883
to make that a little
bit easier for you to do.

00:43:29.883 --> 00:43:32.050
And I showed you some of
the metrics and dashboards,

00:43:32.050 --> 00:43:35.102
but there's a whole suite of
more metrics and dashboards

00:43:35.102 --> 00:43:35.810
that you can use.

00:43:35.810 --> 00:43:37.810
And that's an
